        <p>Use Boox Drop: open the Boox Drop app on the Palma, pair it with the Boox companion app on your phone (or log in to the web version on a computer), then send EPUB files over Wi-Fi. You can also install Google Drive or Dropbox and open EPUB files directly from the cloud, or download them in the built-in browser.</p>
      </div>
