<p>The Boox Palma has become one of the most exciting EPUB readers of 2026 because it finally gives phone-adjacent readers an open, portable, distraction-free screen. With USB side-loading, Boox Drop, cloud sync, and a strong built-in reader, getting your EPUB library onto a Palma takes minutes — and reading on it is a joy. Pair it with a well-organized <a href="/blog/calibre-library-management-guide-2026/">Calibre library</a> and a growing <a href="/blog/drm-free-epub-library-2026/">DRM-free EPUB collection</a>, and you have a pocket reading setup that beats any walled-garden alternative.</p>
